WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.197
Step three: set up this computer.

2
00:00:04.197 --> 00:00:08.665
Install the EdgeCoder desktop app on your Mac or Windows PC.

3
00:00:08.665 --> 00:00:11.421
It runs the agent and Ollama for you.

4
00:00:11.421 --> 00:00:13.729
And it keeps itself up to date.

5
00:00:14.729 --> 00:00:18.922
The app suggests a model sized for this computer.

6
00:00:18.922 --> 00:00:23.885
A good GPU, or a Mac with 32 GB or more, gets a 30B coder.

7
00:00:23.885 --> 00:00:25.853
With 16 GB, a 9B model.

8
00:00:25.853 --> 00:00:32.185
Smaller machines get a smaller model, and send bigger jobs to the network.

9
00:00:33.185 --> 00:00:35.528
Download it for Mac or Windows here.

10
00:00:35.528 --> 00:00:37.545
Then sign in with this account.

11
00:00:38.545 --> 00:00:42.518
Once the app is signed in, this computer joins your account.

12
00:00:42.518 --> 00:00:44.570
This item checks off by itself.

13
00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:46.829
Then press Next.
